    <li>Export rates and the cost at Repsol and Endesa: <a href="https://selectra.es/autoconsumo/tarifas/bateria-virtual/comercializadoras" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Selectra</a>, updated 2 July 2026. Selectra still listed Endesa’s virtual battery as free at that time.</li>
    <li>TotalEnergies and Naturgy: <a href="https://veredictosolar.com/mejor-tarifa-bateria-virtual/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Veredicto Solar</a>, updated 30 September 2026.</li>
