    <li>Compensation scheme: <a href="https://www.boe.es/buscar/act.php?id=BOE-A-2019-5089" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Real Decreto 244/2019</a>. PVPC formula: <a href="https://www.boe.es/diario_boe/txt.php?id=BOE-A-2023-14048" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Real Decreto 446/2023</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="note">This comparison is general information and not a recommendation to choose a particular supplier. Prices and terms change regularly; always check them with the supplier before signing a contract. Spotted a mistake or a changed term? Email us at info@axarquiahome.com and we will update it. We do not sell energy contracts and are not tied to any supplier.</p>
</Guide>
